; a round played on a server (Soldat_online): the connection, the
; player's keys up, the round down, its own soldier predicted and the
; others drawn between two of the server's words. Pure OCaml: the
; browser's program links it. Soldat's shared/network/NetworkClient*.pas.
(library
 (name soldat_online)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   soldat_map soldat_assets soldat_game soldat_net
   caps ; Cap.network: the authority to connect
   tiny_libs.core ; Set_: the keys held
   tiny_libs.random ; Lehmer: the sparks' own chance
   tiny_libs.physics_2d ; Particles: a body's points, between two rounds
   tiny_libs.networking_protocols ; Transport: the connection, on every platform
   tiny_libs.networking_netcode ; Prediction and Interpolation
   elm_playground))
